{"story":{"group_1":[{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"bg_adv_21812.jpg","bgm":"stop","nameNarration":"","narrationBg":"bg_adv_21812.jpg","narrationEffect":"in","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"narration":"<Outskirts of Takarazaki, Campsite>","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"bg_adv_21815.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":1,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":0,"pos":1}],"narrationEffect":"out","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"autoTurnLast":0.1,"nameNarration":"","narrationBg":"","narrationCoverOpacity":160.0,"narrationEffect":"in"},{"armatureList":[{"animation":["action"],"armatureId":1,"filePath":"resource/image_native/effect/story/general/3004_rainstorm.ExportJson","zOrder":"messageBack"}],"autoTurnLast":0.1},{"narration":"*Whoooosh...*","surround":"7004_rain","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"bgm":"bgm23_magus03","chara":[{"id":103201,"motion":400,"mouthOpen":1}],"nameCenter":"Miyui","narrationEffect":"out","textBg":"shout","textCenter":"Why— Why is— Why is it rainiiiing?!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":1,"face":"mtn_ex_053.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":0,"mouthOpen":1}],"nameCenter":"Miyuri","textBg":"shout","textCenter":"I asked Santa!@[chara:103201:lipSynch_0][wait:1.2][chara:103201:lipSynch_1]Nicely![chara:103201:lipSynch_0][wait:1.2] ...[chara:103201:lipSynch_1]And everything![chara:103201:mouthOpen_0]"},{"chara":[{"cheek":1,"id":103201,"motion":300,"mouthOpen":0}],"nameCenter":"Miyuri","textCenter":"I was supposed to have used up my present@rights for the year!"},{"autoTurnLast":0.25,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":103201}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":305401,"motion":200,"pos":2},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_000.exp3.json","id":103101,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"nameRight":"Mitsune","textRight":"...Guess you should've checked with the agency@first..."},{"chara":[{"id":305401}],"nameRight":"Mitsune","textRight":"...to make sure you're allowed to rent your gift@rights in advance, huh?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_042.exp3.json","id":103101,"motion":301,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"San","textLeft":"...I don't think that's the lesson she should be@learning here, do you?"},{"autoTurnLast":0.25,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":103101},{"effect":"fadeout","id":305401}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":102801,"motion":0,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_053.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":1,"pos":2}],"nameLeft":"Himena","textLeft":"Let's just get ready in the tent."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":102801,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"Himena","textLeft":"There's still a shot that it'll clear up tonight@for us to see the stars!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":0}],"nameRight":"Miyuri","textRight":"*Gasp*... You're right!@Even a 1% chance is still a chance."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"Miyuri","textRight":"Santa only smiles on those who believe and@put in the effort!"},{"autoTurnLast":0.25,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":102801},{"effect":"fadeout","id":103201}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":103101,"motion":1,"pos":1}],"nameCenter":"San","textCenter":"...Are you relying entirely on luck and Santa@Claus for this?"},{"autoTurnLast":2.0,"bg":"bg_adv_11131.jpg","bgm":"stop","nameNarration":"","narrationBg":"bg_adv_11131.jpg","narrationEffect":"in","surround":"stop","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"autoTurnLast":0.1,"deleteArmatureList":[1]},{"narration":"<Hokuyo Ward, Crescent House>","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":101501,"lipSynch":1,"motion":1,"pos":1}],"narrationEffect":"out","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"bgm":"bgm03_story02","chara":[{"id":101501,"lipSynch":0}],"nameCenter":"Ui","textCenter":"...","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnLast":0.25,"chara":[{"id":101501,"pos":0}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":100770,"motion":100,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Touka","textRight":"What are mew reading, Ui?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":101501,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"Ui","textLeft":"It's a manga that's popular in my class!@It's about an astronomy club."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":101501}],"nameLeft":"Ui","textLeft":"This is the scene where they're all excited@to catch a shooting star!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_001.exp3.json","id":100770,"motion":0}],"nameRight":"Touka","textRight":"They're trying to catch one...?"},{"autoTurnLast":0.25,"chara":[{"id":100770,"pos":0}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_000.exp3.json","id":101471,"motion":1,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Nemu","textRight":"On film, that is."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":101501,"motion":200,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Ui","textLeft":"...Oh, have you read it too, Nemu?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":101471,"motion":100}],"nameRight":"Nemu","textRight":"I've read the novel it's based on, yes."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_001.exp3.json","id":100770,"motion":200,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Touka","textLeft":"Hmph... Am I the only one out of the loop...?"},{"autoTurnLast":1.5,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":101501,"motion":0,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":100770,"motion":1,"pos":2}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"chara":[{"id":100770}],"nameRight":"Touka","textRight":"...It's true that getting a picture of a shooting@star is an exercise in patience.","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"id":100770}],"nameRight":"Touka","textRight":"The only things you can predict in advance are@meteor showers and satellite flares!"},{"chara":[{"id":101501,"motion":300}],"nameLeft":"Ui","textLeft":"...What do satellites have to do with it?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_000.exp3.json","id":100770,"motion":400,"pos":2},{"id":101501,"motion":0}],"nameRight":"Touka","textRight":"Sometimes the light from them can be mistaken@for shooting stars."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":100770,"motion":1}],"nameRight":"Touka","textRight":"Well, at least until you get a closer look."},{"chara":[{"id":100770}],"nameRight":"Touka","textRight":"For starters,"},{"chara":[{"id":100770}],"nameRight":"Touka","textRight":"most \"shooting stars\" are space junk like@meteorites or other extraterrestrial debris."},{"chara":[{"id":100770,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"Touka","textRight":"Manmade objects aren't unusual, either."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":101501,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"Ui","textLeft":"So it's like stardust falling from the sky, right?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":101471,"motion":300,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Nemu","textRight":"Despite your points being the same,@Ui's words have far more charm..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":100770,"motion":100,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Touka","textLeft":"Speaking of, there's a research institute that@monitors potential shooting star debris."},{"chara":[{"id":100770}],"nameLeft":"Touka","textLeft":"I'm purr-etty sure they publish their detailed@data on the Internet."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":101471,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"Nemu","textRight":"...Essentially, one could use that data..."},{"chara":[{"id":101471}],"nameRight":"Nemu","textRight":"to predict the time and direction of a shooting@star?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":100770,"motion":201}],"nameLeft":"Touka","textLeft":"Eeeexactly! Not with 100% accuracy, though."},{"autoTurnLast":0.25,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":100770},{"effect":"fadeout","id":101471}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":101501,"motion":200,"pos":1}],"nameCenter":"Ui","textCenter":"Woah...!"},{"autoTurnLast":2.0,"bg":"bg_adv_14071.jpg","bgm":"stop","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":120301,"motion":0,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":120302,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"armatureList":[{"animation":["action"],"armatureId":1,"filePath":"resource/image_native/effect/story/general/3003_act_picture.ExportJson","zOrder":"messageBack"}],"autoTurnLast":0.1},{"bgm":"bgm05_event11","chara":[{"id":120301,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"Tsuruno","textLeft":"...Did you hear that, Felicia?","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":120302,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"Felicia","textRight":"Yup, loud and clear!@Sounds like an interestin' manga, huh?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_001.exp3.json","id":120301,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"Tsuruno","textLeft":"Not that part!@If we can get some data from the lab..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":120301,"motion":101,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Tsuruno","textLeft":"We might finally be able to catch a shooting star!"},{"autoTurnLast":1.0,"bg":"black","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"autoTurnLast":0.1,"deleteArmatureList":[1]},{"armatureList":[{"animation":["action"],"armatureId":1,"filePath":"resource/image_native/effect/story/general/1503_motorcycle_loading.ExportJson","zOrder":"messageBack"}],"autoTurnLast":1.0,"turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnLast":2.0,"bgm":"stop","deleteArmatureList":[1],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"}]},"version":3}
